            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Commit: 0b0676d103bfd507ed8e4420c4ab4deae54e4fc4
Channel: beta

feat(settings): add the override-wallpaper toggle to the appearance section

Exposes the desktop override as "覆盖壁纸" under 通用 › 外观, which until now
had no user-facing control at all — its predecessor was gated on
adjustMenuBarTint, a setting no view bound. Off is the default and keeps the
previous behaviour of overriding only while Mirage runs, for menu bar and Dock
tint consistency; on keeps the override after quitting, the way Wallpaper
Engine's option of the same name does.

Both strings are translated in all three tables rather than left equal to
their Simplified Chinese keys, which would have read as Simplified in the
English and Traditional locales without failing visibly (see 8cfc493).

]]></description>
