            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Commit: e4f81afc8c8357034a196841485c7d7055705e07
Channel: beta

fix(app): apply the confirmed wallpaper to the display that asked

Assigning a web wallpaper to a secondary display raised the trust sheet,
whose confirm button applied nextCurrentWallpaper to the main display.
This path never set that property, so confirming put an unrelated
wallpaper on the wrong screen. The pending request now carries the target
screen through the sheet.

]]></description>
