            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Commit: 8cfc493fd0226d57dd4c7ab9da54ad9044d45d09
Channel: beta

fix(i18n): translate the screen saver strings

Every entry in the saver's en and zh-Hant tables was still the Simplified
Chinese key verbatim. Because the keys are themselves Chinese, the missing
translations fell back to the key and read as Simplified in both locales
instead of failing visibly.

zh-Hant follows Taiwan usage rather than a glyph-level conversion:
螢幕保護程式, 元件, 載入, 設定, 影片, 壁紙.

]]></description>
